{"publicId":"4ef50a48-521d-47f4-833c-48e6921cd644","title":"eBay限制第三方AI代理访问致Meta Muse功能受限","status":"settled","reportCount":1,"sourceCount":1,"firstReportAt":"2026-11-10T16:20:30.000Z","latestAt":"2026-11-10T16:20:30.000Z","digest":"eBay自2026年11月起限制第三方AI代理访问平台，导致Meta的Muse无法获取商品链接及价格信息【新】。此举与亚马逊全面封禁、Target部分限制形成对比，反映零售商对AI代理数据访问的分歧态度。根据The Verge报道，eBay通过技术手段阻断AI代理爬取数据，其政策依据为\"零售商和服务商对第三方AI代理访问平台存在不同风险容忍度\"的公开表述【新】。目前受影响的主要是依赖eBay数据训练的AI工具，尚未波及平台自身AI功能。","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-10T16:48:11.374Z","summary":null,"excerpt":null,"latest":"eBay限制第三方AI代理访问平台","latestReport":{"id":"rl3efh03e92mqh5iemsalci3w"},"whyHot":{"participants48h":0,"newParticipants6h":0,"recentReports24h":0,"observationComplete":true,"rank":null},"developments":[{"factId":"fxNAw5x4ol5Y","title":"eBay限制AI代理访问","firstReportAt":"2026-11-10T16:20:30.000Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"rl3efh03e92mqh5iemsalci3w","title":"eBay限制第三方AI代理访问平台","summary":"eBay近期限制第三方AI代理访问其平台，导致Meta的Muse无法获取商品链接和价格信息。对比亚马逊全面封禁、Target部分限制、Shopify开放策略，分析AI智能体在电商中的实际应用挑战与潜在影响。","source":{"name":"The Verge · AI","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-10T16:20:30.000Z","selected":false}}],"officialReports":[],"timeline":[{"id":"rl3efh03e92mqh5iemsalci3w","title":"eBay限制第三方AI代理访问平台","summary":"eBay近期限制第三方AI代理访问其平台，导致Meta的Muse无法获取商品链接和价格信息。对比亚马逊全面封禁、Target部分限制、Shopify开放策略，分析AI智能体在电商中的实际应用挑战与潜在影响。","source":{"name":"The Verge · AI","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-10T16:20:30.000Z","selected":false}],"heat":[{"hour":"2026-11-12T03:00:00.000Z","heat":3.7,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-12T04:00:00.000Z","heat":3.6,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-12T05:00:00.000Z","heat":3.5,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-12T07:00:00.000Z","heat":3.3,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-12T08:00:00.000Z","heat":3.2,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-12T09:00:00.000Z","heat":3.1,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-12T10:00:00.000Z","heat":3,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-12T12:00:00.000Z","heat":2.8,"participants":1},